OL,3,ALego fraudster among last year's most
OL,4,Ahigh-profile insurance scammers
OL,5,
OL,6,FA scammer jailed for making false home
OL,7,Finsurance claims about supposedly
OL,8,Fstolen Lego has been listed as one of
OL,9,Flast year's most high-profile insurance
OL,10,Ffraudsters.
OL,12,FThe person was sentenced to 28 months
OL,13,Fin prison after an investigation found
OL,14,Fthe claims were made up, insurance
OL,15,Ftrade body the ABI said.
OL,17,FOther insurance fraud cases flagged by
OL,18,Fthe ABI include someone who staged car
OL,19,Fcrashes with people they met online and
OL,20,Fa complex travel insurance scam
OL,21,Finvolving multiple fake identities and
OL,22,Fdocuments.
